<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112015" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιτ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιταλέος</span>
			, of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάκχαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				165
			</span></i> (lyr., pl.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἀγύρτρια,</span>
			of Cassandra, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1273
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. νόσος</span>”
				<i>madness, frenzy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					980
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. πλάνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					610
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ῥιπή,</span> of the
				<i>flickering</i> of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				231
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἐμπορίη,</span> of commerce
				<i>by sea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.586
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>): also with neut. Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιτάσι πτεροῖς</span> on <i>wandering</i> wings, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1024
			</span></i> (lyr.): late also with masc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιτάδι μόχθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jo.Gaz.
					<u>Ecphr.</u>
					1.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					38.260
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>much trodden, frequented,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
